This repository is an unofficial Vietnamese translation of
"Introduction to Computer Vision: Lecture Notes with Working Python Code"
by Stan Birchfield (arXiv:2609.39627, https://sbirchfield.github.io/cvintro/),
which is licensed under CC BY 4.0.

Changes: the explanatory text, titles, quizzes and page interface were
translated into Vietnamese, and page paths were adjusted so the site runs
standalone. Technical content, code, figures, animations and outputs are
unchanged and remain the work of the original author.

The translation is distributed under the same license:
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International.

You are free to share and adapt this material for any purpose, provided you
give appropriate credit (to the original author, and to this translation),
provide a link to the license, and indicate if changes were made.

Full legal code: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
